Section 1:
    Requirement giveb by User :
        Build an agentic platform ( use Google ADK)  where you can configure agents, MCP.
        Build following agents - search agent RAG, Content Summarizer agent
        Build MCP connectivity provision in the Agentic Framework.
        Memory - STM(short term memory), LTM(Long term memory)
        Orchestration - Use decision making models to prepare the pr

        Use case:

        User will provide n pdfs to ingest as a one-time activity
        User will provide web-links as content source
        User will ask a query in the user interface, the orchestrator will pick the appropriate agent and search for the answers in the content using RAG agent ( sourcing both document content and web content)

        Users may give a long text and ask to summarize the content. The summarizer agent should be invoked and appropriate response should be given

        Users should be able to configure any external MCP server in the framework. So when a question is asked by the user, the search agent should look for local content ( RAG agent) and also from MCP connected content.

Section 2:
    Few following points I got from the high level as part of requirement 
        1. new mcp service should be configurable in future
        2. fetch information from rag
        3.  reranking the information
        4. accuracy of information is critical
        5. Ingest the file type as in this requirement it is PDF but in future files can be different-different format